        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\ntitle: Personal Assistant - System Architecture\nconfig:\n  layout: elk\n---\nflowchart LR\n  subgraph Clients\n    App[\&quot;Mobile app&lt;br&gt;React Native / Expo&lt;br&gt;voice in, spoken read-back\&quot;]\n    Shortcut[\&quot;iOS Shortcut&lt;br&gt;Hey Siri, dictate\&quot;]\n    ClaudeApp[\&quot;Claude app&lt;br&gt;optional custom connector\&quot;]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Backend[\&quot;Backend (AWS)\&quot;]\n    API[\&quot;API Gateway&lt;br&gt;Cognito JWT auth\&quot;]\n    Orch[\&quot;Agent orchestrator&lt;br&gt;tool-use loop, history,&lt;br&gt;system prompt\&quot;]\n    subgraph Tools[\&quot;MCP tool server\&quot;]\n      Cal[\&quot;Calendar tools&lt;br&gt;confirm-first\&quot;]\n      Logs[\&quot;Logging and analytics&lt;br&gt;SQL rollups\&quot;]\n      Notes[\&quot;Notes&lt;br&gt;pgvector search\&quot;]\n      Rem[\&quot;Reminders&lt;br&gt;create, cancel, undo\&quot;]\n      Lists[\&quot;Lists and chores\&quot;]\n      Digest[\&quot;Daily digest&lt;br&gt;ranked check-in items\&quot;]\n    end\n    DB[(\&quot;Postgres on RDS&lt;br&gt;source of truth\&quot;)]\n    Sched[\&quot;EventBridge Scheduler&lt;br&gt;one-off reminders + cron\&quot;]\n    Checkin[\&quot;Check-in Lambda&lt;br&gt;morning check-in\&quot;]\n    Notifier[\&quot;Notifier Lambda&lt;br&gt;send channel, user, message\&quot;]\n  end\n\n  subgraph External[\&quot;External services\&quot;]\n    Claude[\&quot;Claude API&lt;br&gt;Sonnet chat, Haiku jobs\&quot;]\n    GCal[\&quot;Google Calendar API\&quot;]\n    Embed[\&quot;Embeddings API\&quot;]\n    ExpoPush[\&quot;Expo push&lt;br&gt;APNs / FCM\&quot;]\n    SES[\&quot;Amazon SES&lt;br&gt;email\&quot;]\n    Twilio[\&quot;Twilio&lt;br&gt;SMS, critical only\&quot;]\n  end\n\n  App --&gt;|text or transcript| API\n  Shortcut --&gt;|dictated text| API\n  API --&gt; Orch\n  Orch &lt;--&gt;|messages + tool defs| Claude\n  Orch --&gt;|tool calls| Tools\n  ClaudeApp --&gt;|MCP| Tools\n  Cal --&gt; GCal\n  Notes --&gt; Embed\n  Logs --&gt; DB\n  Notes --&gt; DB\n  Lists --&gt; DB\n  Digest --&gt; DB\n  Rem --&gt; DB\n  Rem --&gt;|create schedule| Sched\n  Sched --&gt;|fire reminder| Notifier\n  Sched --&gt;|cron 7:00| Checkin\n  Checkin --&gt; Digest\n  Checkin --&gt;|write check-in| Claude\n  Checkin --&gt; Notifier\n  Notifier --&gt; ExpoPush\n  Notifier --&gt; SES\n  Notifier --&gt; Twilio\n  ExpoPush --&gt; App\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2">
